('CS50: Introduction to Computer Science', 'Harvard''s broad, project-based tour of computer science — C, algorithms, memory, and data structures from first principles.', 'Programming Fundamentals', 'beginner', 100, ARRAY['programming-fundamentals','c','algorithms'], ARRAY[]::text[], 'https://cs50.harvard.edu/x/'),
